scription": "# Trickshots \u2013 The Ultimate VR Challenge!  \nTrickshots is a **physics-driven VR arcade game** where skill, creativity, and a little chaos collide!  \n\ud83d\ude80 Hit giant soccer balls into giant red cups inside **giant environments!**\n\n\n---\n{615395374790353}  \n\n# \u26f3 5 Full Courses, 45 Trickshot Holes!  \nTrickshots isn\u2019t just about mini-games\u2014there are **5 full courses** with **45 insanely difficult holes** of **Trickshots Golf!**  \nEvery hole is a **new puzzle**, pushing your **precision, creativity, and patience** to the limit!  \n\n---\n\n{513450385195256}  \n# \ud83c\udfae 15 Mini-Games\nEach of the **15 mini-games** in Trickshots brings a **fresh challenge**\u2014can you **master them all**?  \nTest your **skills**, adapt to **wild mechanics**, and **outsmart tricky physics** in every game!  \n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n\n{1438381634201281}", "short_description": "Trickshots is a physics-driven VR arcade game where skill, creativity, and a little chaos collide! Launch giant soccer balls into giant red cups inside giant environments!\n\n- All updates and content will be free\u2014forever!\n- No refunds for the frustration you'll feel trying to beat each course."}]}, "developer_name": "Alex Howell", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.trickshotsvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.trickshotsvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Alex Howell", "support_website_url": "https://www.trickshotsvr.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.trickshotsvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, 